39782477", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823485_1415358243115810_7767185752610860171_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_5G0s0t6Gq8Q7kNvwFQTZmS&_nc_oc=AdoIijwV880Z_Vj08Gf_sISeXAl1lHpFOasReJ45XambZTl7xbAr9Kvdhud0LgrSfYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-eNFPLEUtTK4rwOAJ6aNf0WmkJz88WOrjuSH9yzydrKA&oe=6A467D37"}, {"file_name": "untitled.png", "id": "24979304018336283", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_24979304025002949_1358537660123093337_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0TOouAsB1ecQ7kNvwFVZOiV&_nc_oc=AdpSp8ssKf_MIPSl-TDXRbumDH8fbbLeTgSe-ksmQ7yJK7kI6ppcF8L4khMAvsW4rd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-VJfsEjOpvn6tSjsI19BB5fxaoHutOfymYMIZPwlfoyQ&oe=6A468879"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "John's Basics", "keywords": ["Horror", "BaldiBasics", "Multiplayer", "Baldi", "Basics"], "long_description": "# **John\u2019s Basics**\n\n**John\u2019s Basics** is a chilling VR horror experience inspired by the classic *Baldi\u2019s Basics*.\n\nStep into twisted classrooms, solve brain-bending puzzles, and try to stay one step ahead of **John**\u2014a relentless threat in a warped school that feeds on your mistakes.\n\nThe deeper you go, the darker it gets.\n\nWith eerie soundscapes, sudden scares, and a constant feeling of being watched, **John\u2019s Basics** doesn\u2019t just test your wits\u2014it plays with your sanity.\n\n---\n\n**Think you\u2019re smart enough to survive school?**  \n**Prove it.**\n", "short_description": "A twisted VR horror-lite experience inspired by Baldi\u2019s Basics\u2014where learning gets unsettling."}]}, "developer_name": "Mythborn Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johns-learning.co.uk/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://johns-learning.co.uk/tos", "publisher_name": "Mythborn Games", "support_website_url": nul